{
  "id": "supply-run",
  "title": "Supply run",
  "description": "A fictional 30-minute logistics exercise in Halden: keep kitchens, shelters, a clinic and a pumping station supplied from two depots, Tosterød in the west and Brekke in the east, with trucks of different payloads. A routine request needs a truck of at least 500 kg and an urgent bulk request a heavy truck of at least 1,000 kg; only Truck 2 and Truck 4 are heavy. Truck 2 joins at 2 minutes, the 300 kg Truck 1 is upgraded to 600 kg at 3 and a hired 700 kg Truck 5 joins at 5½. Three choices matter: divert Truck 2 from a routine request to the pumping station; give the scout camp and the farm shop to Truck 3 in one chain, so Truck 4 stays home for the clinic; and add the guest harbour to the end of a busy truck's chain rather than send Truck 4 across town. Places and requests are invented for the exercise. How to play: tap a request to see the suggested truck, then tap the suggestion to send it; a divert asks you to confirm. Or tap one of your trucks to highlight it, then tap a request; a busy truck offers Do now or Add to end, or only Add to end once it is unloading. For a chain, tap Truck 3, then R-5, then the + on Truck 3 and R-6.",
  "objectives": ["Get a heavy truck to every urgent bulk request within 4 minutes of the request.", "Let no request wait more than 10 minutes for a truck."],
  "world": {"startsAt": "2026-09-03T08:00:00.000Z", "environment": {"city": "Halden", "model": "Fictional logistics exercise"}},
